    "## Instantiate Models\n",
    "This cell creates the two HMM model instances used throughout the notebook: one configured with the I/G probabilities for the Viterbi algorithm, and one configured with the I/E probabilities for the Forward, Backward, and Forward–Backward algorithms.\n",
    
